        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Daniel Bodansky is Regents’ Professor of Law at Arizona State University and formerly served as U.S. State Department Climate Change Coordinator (1999–2001). His work has shaped climate diplomacy at both national and international levels. He is the author of The Art and Craft of International Environmental Law (Harvard University Press), and co-author of International Climate [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
