        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Buzz Brass: Famous Inspirations"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Sun Jan 25, 2:30pm | With flair, finesse, and fun, Canada’s renowned Buzz Brass quintet brings classical masterpieces into bold new focus. In Famous Inspirations, the group reimagines beloved works by Debussy, Ravel, Piazzolla, Dvořák, and Liszt—including the iconic Hungarian Rhapsody No. 2 —through dazzling original arrangements. These turn-of-the-century classics are transformed through the brilliance [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
